      "author": "buraglio",
      "authorAssociation": "OWNER",
      "assignees": [],
      "labels": [],
      "body": "\u2026de line length\n\n- Move RFC8200 to normative; add inline citations for RFC8200 and RFC4291 in \u00a71\n- Remove RFC6234 (redundant with RFC4982) and unused KATA/KEYLIME entries\n- Add RFC7217 citation in \u00a79.3 privacy linkability comparison\n- Add SPIRE citation in \u00a79.5 hardware root of trust table\n- Reword `subnet_prefix[8]` and `hcga_prefix_bytes[8]` prose in \u00a73/\u00a75.4 and \u00a75.2 to avoid idnits parsing bare `[8]` as a missing reference link\n- Replace non-ASCII `\u2264` with `<=` and `64\u2212L` with `64-L` in \u00a75.7\n- Split non-byte-aligned inner loop line in \u00a75.3 and Appendix B (was 84 chars) into hi/lo temporaries to stay within idnits line-length limit",
